<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
@page{margin:28mm 18mm 24mm}body{font-family:DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;color:#172033;font-size:10px}h1{font-size:24px;color:#172b4d}.muted{color:#64748b}.columns{width:100%;margin-top:24px}.columns td{width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:16px}table.lines{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:20px}.lines th,.lines td{border-bottom:1px solid #d8e0eb;padding:8px 5px;text-align:right}.lines th:first-child,.lines td:first-child{text-align:left}.lines th{background:#f1f5f9}.totals{width:45%;margin-left:55%;margin-top:16px}.totals td{padding:4px}.legal{margin-top:24px;font-size:9px;color:#475569}.footer{position:fixed;bottom:-14mm;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:8px;color:#64748b}
</style></head><body>
<p class="muted">SYMFOERP · FACTURATION</p><h1>AVOIR {{ credit_note.number }}</h1>
<p>Date : {{ credit_note.creditDate|date('d/m/Y') }} · Facture d’origine : {{ invoice.number }}</p>
<table class="columns"><tr><td><strong>ÉMETTEUR</strong><br>{{ seller.legal_name }}<br>{{ seller.address }}<br>{{ seller.postal_code }} {{ seller.city }}<br>{{ seller.country }}<br>SIREN : {{ seller.siren }} · SIRET : {{ seller.siret }}</td><td><strong>CLIENT</strong><br>{{ customer.name }}<br>{{ customer.address }}<br>{{ customer.postal_code }} {{ customer.city }}<br>{{ customer.country }}</td></tr></table>
<h2>Motif de l’avoir</h2><p>{{ credit_note.reason|nl2br }}</p>
<table class="lines"><thead><tr><th>Désignation</th><th>Qté</th><th>Prix HT</th><th>TVA</th><th>Total HT</th><th>Total TTC</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for line in credit_note.lines %}<tr><td>{{ line.description }}</td><td>{{ line.quantity }}</td><td>{{ line.unitPrice|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td><td>{{ line.vatRate|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} %</td><td>{{ line.totalExcludingTax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td><td>{{ line.totalIncludingTax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</tbody></table>
<table class="totals"><tr><td>Total HT</td><td style="text-align:right">{{ credit_note.totalExcludingTax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td></tr><tr><td>Total TVA</td><td style="text-align:right">{{ credit_note.totalTax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total TTC</strong></td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>{{ credit_note.totalIncludingTax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</strong></td></tr></table>
<div class="legal"><p>Avoir émis en référence à la facture {{ invoice.number }}. À déduire du montant dû ou à rembourser selon la situation du compte client.</p><p><strong>TVA :</strong> {{ seller.vat_regime_note }}</p></div>
<div class="footer">{{ credit_note.number }} · Document émis par SYMFOERP</div></body></html>
